  "method": "Fresh anonymous Edge; expose webpack loader without replacing official domain functions. Read real blocks/registry. After initialization abort every HTTP request and WebSocket. Call chat/OCR only with browser offline; cognitive only anonymous; classifier offline with '?' and an authored non-model identifier. No AI backend/model/photo request is permitted.",
