    "Direct registry calls, not native project execution.",
    "Offline/anonymous/missing-model branches only; no logged-in AI, camera, prediction or model initialization.",
    "Registry function hashes describe registry wrappers, not the underlying domain bodies; source locations are the independent body evidence.",
    "Third-party source is only in ignored dist; tracked evidence contains metadata/hashes, not function bodies."
  ],
